    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hi, i'm a bit overwhelmed with the visa situation for an upcoming engineering team trip through SE Asia. we're hitting multiple countries like vietnam, thailand, and indonesia. i'm really struggling to distinguish when we need a full entry visa vs just a transit visa for laying over in certain hubs. can you give me a basic checklist or breakdown of what we need to look out for so nobody gets stuck at customs? thanks.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
